# Keep the build context small. Everything the Dockerfile COPYs must stay in:
# Directory.Build.props (TargetFramework for every project) and src/Touchline.Api/.
# CI runs "docker build" (job "docker"), so excluding a needed file fails the PR.
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/bin
**/obj
tests
docs
scripts
.github
.env*
**/*.user
